      "title": "Dividend of ₹0.60 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹0.60. Ex-date: 17th February 2026 Payment date: 13th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.6%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.9%.",
